1. Doubled the number of the rooms with brand new types;
2. As 1.0, each room provides a treasure chest in which you may find weapons, coins or recovery items;
3. Increased the probability that the chest will drop recovery items or gold coins to provide sufficient recovery items;
4. Increased coins dropped by the monsters for players to customize thier weapons;
5. Increased the strength of the original weapons that belongs to the characters. Powered up the skill of The Ninja greatly and the skill of Alpha and Ponpon slightly. Skills will be more useful;
6. Improved cactus attack area warning and some enemies attack animation as well as thier strength balance;
7. Coins will be converted to fruit cores after the level passed as well as Game Over. You progress anyway;
8. Fixed the achievement system.

Juicy Realm has been launched on Steam for two months. During this time, I am grateful to the support of every player.

Looking back the whole development journey with my partner biboX from two years ago, we had to give up many ideas because our dev team was lack of people and experience. However, you guys’s feedback made me thought a lot things; and we also have recruited some experienced employees. So we finally decided to rewrite most of Juicy Realm’s system. In other words, recently we won't make too many updates until our system rewrite is complete.

I feel sorry for your long-time waiting. But please trust me, your waiting will be worth. Juicy Realm is the first game by SpaceCan Games. We’ll try our best to improve it.

Our rewrite plan including:
Add more characters, Bosses, and fruit enemies;
Expand the difference between different characters;
Build the character cultivation system;
Add more NPC and more random events;
Design new map style to make players can freely explore;
Build random map system;
Change the current Boss fights mode;
Add more weapons and props;
Build the weapon reinforcement system;
Build the pets system;
and so on...

Overall, I’d like to thank all players who have been waiting for and supporting Juicy Realm. Please look forward to totally NEW Juicy Realm in THIS WINTER!!!

P.S. Juicy Realm 2.0 will be a BIG free update! If you have bought Juicy Realm, don’t worry, you don’t need to pay more.

