Update News 11th May 2018

Hey everyone,
 
Update list for the latest patch:
 
1. Fixed the enemy sign is not hidden when player has cleared the area;
2. Fixed the unlimited ammo bug;
3. No more enemy when player crushes the small box;
4. Increased damage of melee weapons;
5. Reduced damage of traps;
6. Fixed screen resolution occasionally reset bug;
7. Fixed the boss of stage 1, watermelon, would get stuck at the edge of the map;
8. Added killing enemy randomly drops a small amount of ammo
 
Thank you,
